# JW Stone public media lives in the existing R2 bucket. The checked-in
# migration manifest preserves source identity without returning image bytes
# to the application repository or Docker build context.
/client/public/images/businesses/jw-stone/

# R.E.D. Graniti source imagery follows the same R2-backed public-media path.
# Build-time downloads and generated image payloads are intentionally forbidden.
/client/public/images/businesses/red-graniti/source/

